    discussion: ['II. You are Emma. Your tutor is Claire. Confirm your design task and ask how it connects with Ren\'s work.', 'あなたはエマ役、講師はクレア役です。デザインの担当を確認し、レンの作業とどうつながるか尋ねましょう。'], followup: 'How could you ask to hear a deadline again?',
