    mission: { situation: ['You are Ren at 11:15 on Sunday. Your tutor is a vendor arriving after the first rain update. Read the new handover and explain the current display, collection and opening arrangements.', 'あなたは日曜日の11時15分に会場にいるレン役、講師は最初の雨の案内の後に到着した出店者役です。新しい引き継ぎを読み、今の展示場所、受け取り、開催について説明しましょう。'], task: ['Use the latest information to answer the vendor\'s questions. Correct old assumptions about outdoor stalls and the photograph display, and explain who can approve a layout change.', '最新の情報で出店者の質問に答えましょう。屋外の売り場や写真の場所について古い思い込みを訂正し、配置の変更を承認する人も伝えましょう。'], roles: ['Vendor', 'Ren'], title: '11:15 Handover - Latest Indoor Arrangements', text: '<p><strong>Still current:</strong> The market stays indoors until closing at 2 p.m. Outdoor stalls will not reopen today.</p><p><strong>New display detail:</strong> Photo prints are now on the back wall, not by the window. The craft demonstration begins at noon at shared table A.</p><p><strong>Orders:</strong> Reserved pastry orders can be collected at the counter from 1 p.m. Leo will confirm each order there; a reservation is not proof it has already been paid.</p><p><strong>Space:</strong> Keep the entrance and main aisle clear. Extra stock stays in the dry back room. Ask Claire before moving a shared table; vendors do not each have a separate full-size indoor stall.</p>', lines: ['Hello, I saw the old outdoor plan. Can I set up outside now?', 'Where are the photo prints? I thought they were by the window.', 'When and where is the craft demonstration?', 'A customer has a pastry reservation. Where and when should they collect it?', 'Does a reservation mean the customer has already paid?', 'Can I move a shared table myself? What should I keep clear?'], evidence: 'Indoorsuntil2/outdoorsnotreopen; photosbackwall notwindow; craftnoonsharedtableA; pastryreservedpickupcounterfrom1 Leo confirms order/payment; reservationnotpaymentproof; Claireapprovesmoves, entrance/aisleclear, extra stockdrybackroom. New details are not in Apply. Do not invent an extra separate stall or say the whole event is cancelled.', useful: ['The latest update says ...', 'That part of the old plan has changed.', 'You can find ... at ...', 'It starts at ...', 'A reservation does not necessarily mean ...', 'Please check with Claire before ...'] },
